# The PDA profile (report 038 S2, section 3.4) on the profile pda (480x800 = the Pi 3A+ DSI turned, 480x640 = a 3.5"
# panel turned): multitasking is on where the short side is at least 480, so the switcher screen "Open apps" exists on
# the portrait panels. Its 2x2 cards and the bar keep 7 mm targets inside the panel (expect_targets); a first word too
# wide for the line beside a card's X ("Serial" at 9.0 px/mm) starts the name under the X instead of being cut between
# its characters. The header is checked against the home grid's (run.sh header). Goldens at both sizes.
title pda switcher
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
# the portrait launcher without the writing zone (report 040, S2): kept as the regression of a portrait canvas
# without APPLAUNCH_PDA; the zone itself: the zone_* scenes (report 041)
env APPLAUNCH_PDA 0
apps "Serial Console=cli_100.png" "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=store_100.png" "System Monitor=game_100.png" "Spectrum Analyzer for the Software Defined Radio=tank_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "An App With A Thirty Char Name=math_100.png" Settings
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
switcher "Serial Console=front" "Mesh Hop=running" "RSS Reader=paused"
shot pda_switcher_three
header pda_switcher "Open apps"
expect_text "Open apps"
expect_targets
tapitem close1 edge
expect_event close Mesh Hop
tapitem card2
expect_event pick RSS Reader
tapitem home
expect_event home
tapitem closeall
expect_event close-all
key ESC
expect_event cancel
switcher "RSS Reader=front" "Mesh Hop=running" "Serial Console=nr" "System Monitor=paused"
shot pda_switcher_four
expect_targets
switcher "Serial Console=front" "System Monitor=running" "Net Toolbox=paused" "An App With A Thirty Char Name=nr"
switcher select card0
shot pda_switcher_names
expect_targets
switcher "Spectrum Analyzer for the Software Defined Radio=front"
shot pda_switcher_one
expect_targets
switcher off
